ny Planning. Performed full browser navigation/reload to /checklists and then / (dashboard). After reload, all tiles still showed '1 saved' for Venues/Vendors/Checklists, Your Favorites section still listed Sunset Beach Resort and Eternal Moments Photography, and Your Saved Checklists still listed Ceremony Planning (1 of 5 completed) — all data persisted correctly after reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Current/past date accepted instead of rejected\", \"actual\": \"Set Wedding Date to today's date (2026-08-25, not a future date) and clicked Save; the dashboard updated to show \\\"Aug 25, 2026\\\" as the wedding date, replacing the previously saved future date \\\"Jun 15, 2027\\\". Expected the non-future date to be rejected and the prior date retained.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"View Details/View Profile buttons do not open listing details\", \"actual\": \"Clicked \\\"View Details\\\" on the venue \\\"Rosewood Garden Estate\\\" and \\\"View Profile\\\" on the vendor \\\"Eternal Moments Photography\\\"; in both cases no modal, panel, or page navigation occurred and no additional details were shown. Page URL and content remained unchanged.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Checked 'Write your vows' task on Ceremony Planning checklist: progress updated immediately 0%→20%. Unchecked it: progress immediately reverted 20%→0%. Re-checked it: 20% again. Dashboard Planning Progress matched (20%) while checklist was saved. Performed full page reload (navigate to /checklists then /): checklist still showed 'Saved' badge and 20% progress; Dashboard still showed Planning Progress 20% and 'Ceremony Planning - 1 of 5 completed' in Saved Checklists preview, confirming completion state persists after reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing into search box and clicking filter chips updated the visible results and \\\"Showing X of Y\\\" count immediately without any submit/search button click. Clearing all filters via \\\"Clear all filters\\\" button instantly restored the full list (8/8 venues, 10/10 vendors).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cancel does not discard draft form state\", \"actual\": \"After changing Partner One to \\\"TempName\\\" and Budget to 99999 then clicking Cancel, the dashboard display correctly remained \\\"Alex & Jordan\\\" / $30,000, but reopening the editor via \\\"Update Details\\\" showed the cancelled draft values (TempName, 99999) instead of the last saved values (Alex, 30000).\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Dashboard shows couple names \\\"Alex & Jordan\\\", formatted date \\\"Jun 15, 2027\\\", budget \\\"$30,000\\\", guest count \\\"150\\\", Planning Progress 0% with progress bar, and 0 saved previews for Venues/Vendors/Checklists.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Venue cards (e.g. \\\"Rosewood Garden Estate\\\") show name, location (Napa Valley, CA), category (Garden), price range (Luxury $$$), rating (4.9), summary, and guest capacity (Up to 200 guests). Vendor cards (e.g. \\\"Eternal Moments Photography\\\") show name, location (Los Angeles, CA), service type (Photography), price range (Luxury $$$), rating (4.9), summary, and specialties (Candid Shots, Drone Photography, Same-Day Edits).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Category tabs (All, Planning, Ceremony, Reception, Attire, Honeymoon) present. \\\"All\\\" view lists checklists covering Planning (12+ Months Before, 8-10 Months Before), Ceremony (Ceremony Planning), Reception (Reception Details), Attire (Wedding Attire), and Honeymoon (Ho